t porcupine in my notes? like which ones mention it\", \"ok and uh... is there anything in my pictures about it too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0027\", \"v\": [[\"Kingsbridge Leisure pics\", \"hang on, next seeing Vesna Castellano?\", \"ok back to the pics, weekend only\", \"first one, where taken?\", \"studio wifi?\", \"what'd I pay for the deposit?\"], [\"umm can you pull up my pictures from Kingsbridge Leisure?\", \"oh wait, hang on, when am I next seeing Vesna Castellano?\", \"ok right, going back to the photos... can I just see the weekend ones?\", \"and the first one, umm, where was that taken?\", \"oh different thing, what's the, uh, studio wifi again?\", \"and umm how much did I pay for the deposit?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please move the whirligig back a day?\"], [\"umm can you just bump the whirligig back a day?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0029\", \"v\": [[\"did i bin the waterlily photo?\"], [\"Could you tell me whether I deleted the waterlily photo, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0030\", \"v\": [[\"can u find the ask nomara thing\", \"hang on whats in the vault about turret\", \"and whats else in that notebook\"], [\"Could you find the ask nomara one for me, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget: what do I have in the vault about turret?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me what else is in that notebook?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0031\", \"v\": [[\"can u sort it so i settle up with Brelleth in Hyrby pls\"], [\"Could you please settle up with Brelleth in Hyrby for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0032\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please add fourteen euros for Brelleth's tickets to Hyrby? I paid for them.\", \"Also, would you mind putting lunch with Owyn in my calendar on sunday at 1pm, please?\"], [\"I'm just catching up on the group spending, so can you add fourteen euros for Brelleth's tickets to Hyrby? I was the one who paid.\", \"Oh and another thing, Owyn and I finally agreed on a time, so can you pop lunch with Owyn in the diary for sunday at 1pm?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0033\", \"v\": [[\"umm which steps of the unpack the plum at café kingsbridge job are still, like, open?\", \"oh and uh what did I pay for the crycombe yard?\", \"sorry so... how much was it?\"], [\"unpack the plum at café kingsbridge, open steps?\", \"crycombe yard, what'd I pay?\", \"how much?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0034\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete my paint task?\", \"Also, could you tell me what's left to do on the order thelel's inglenook plan?\"], [\"I've decided I'm not doing it myself after all, so could you get rid of my paint task?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to get ahead on the house stuff, so what's still left to do on the order thelel's inglenook plan?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0035\", \"v\": [[\"what time is the birding thing\"], [\"Could you tell me what time the birding thing is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0036\", \"v\": [[\"new router password pls\"], [\"Would you mind generating a new password for the router, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0037\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you give me the, uh, studio wifi details?\", \"oh and which events are at... at Crickhowell Marsh?\"], [\"A friend's asking how to get online at the studio, so could you pull up the studio wifi details for me?\", \"Totally different thing: I'm trying to work out how often I end up out there, so which events have I got at Crickhowell Marsh?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0038\", \"v\": [[\"hows next week looking, how many events do i have\", \"also whats the hurling lesson membership info\"], [\"I'm trying to work out if I'll get any breathing room, so for next week, how many events have I actually got?\", \"Oh, and I can never remember this stuff, so what are my hurling lesson membership details?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w06-0039\", \"v\": [[\"umm so for next week... which events have I got on?\"], [\"I'm trying to plan around what looks like a busy stretch, so looking at next week, which events do I have on?\"]]}","ttft_ms":28251,"type":"result","duration_ms":39627,"uuid":"